Responsibilities of the role:

&nbsp;

A Manager - Planning will be assigned to manage a group of brands and oversee a team of Planners. &nbsp;She will also handle specific brands and perform the following tasks:

&nbsp;

Attend &amp; receive Client Communication/Media Briefing

Deliver strategic communication response to business issues/challenges

Recommend platforms (ATL &amp;Digital) and investment level based on objectives and strategic directions

Manage brand budget on an annual and monthly level

Monitor and analyze brand &amp; competitive activities to gain learnings and best practices

Lead discussions with brand team on communication reviews and upcoming media plans/activities

Utilize different media and research tools/studies to craft data-based media solutions

Deliver accurate and timely tracking reports

Collaborate with the different teams (internal and external) to ensure smooth and holistic delivery of requirements

